  "display_title": "Match Made In Bed",
  "description": "As far as Cha Dain’s concerned, orgasms are an urban myth. After yet another boyfriend accuses her of being terrible in bed, she and her friends find comfort in the arms of some handsome hosts at a karaoke bar. But Dain gets more than her money’s worth with one host, Han-hae, and their electric night of sex proves to be the answer to all her prayers. Their chemistry is undeniable, and after that night, fate has them running into each other around every corner. But constant miscommunications and reminders of where they first met make it surprisingly difficult for them to truly commit to this relationship. Can these lovers figure out how to put aside their egos and embrace something completely new?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
